Package: chronicle
Version: 1.0.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Anurag, Tanishk Gupta, Divyanshi Singh, Prajjwal Singh <chronicle@geu.ac.in>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-psutil
Recommends: python3-joblib, python3-numpy, python3-pandas, python3-webview, python3-pystray, python3-pil, bpfcc-tools, python3-bpfcc
Description: Intelligent Host Behaviour Analysis & Activity Monitor
 Chronicle is a Linux host behavioral analysis system designed to track
 and evaluate process activity against historical baselines to detect deviations,
 anomalies, and misuse with local-first privacy guarantees.
